## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates the ability to design a complete AWS-native pipeline integrating AI services while maintaining security, reliability, and cost efficiency. It tests understanding of event-driven architectures, service integration patterns, and production-ready best practices.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven orchestration using S3, Lambda, and Step Functions
- AWS AI/ML services: Comprehend (sentiment analysis, key phrase extraction) and Polly (text-to-speech synthesis)
- Data governance: encryption (SSE-KMS), least-privilege IAM principles, and granular access controls
- Production reliability: retry strategies, exponential backoff, dead-letter queues, and comprehensive logging
- Cost optimization: payload size limits, efficient service usage patterns, and monitoring strategies

